      "id": "idea",
      "narration": "Here is the uncomfortable part. Winners and losers often share the exact same goals. The goal was never the thing that truly set them apart. What separated them was the system they ran, quietly, every single day. Goals are fine for setting a direction. But systems are what actually make the progress. So if you want a better result, stop fixating on the target, and fix the system that points at it.",
